👉 C is a general-purpose, procedural, high-level programming language developed by Dennis Ritchie in 1972 at Bell Labs. 
   It is widely used for system programming, application development, and embedded systems because of its speed and efficiency.

=======================
| C Language Features |
=======================
_____________________________________________________________
| Feature    | Meaning                                      |
| ---------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| Simple     | Easy syntax                                  |
| Fast       | High execution speed                         |
| Portable   | Runs on different platforms                  |
| Structured | Code is divided into functions               |
| Efficient  | Uses memory efficiently                      |
| Powerful   | Can build Operating Systems and Applications |
-------------------------------------------------------------
